F1A5   1F 05                  TFR   D,PC   ; back to the dispatcher
F1A7                             ; "[" followed by a letter stores the body"s address in that letter"s cell:
F1A7                             ; uppercase is a word, lowercase a variable. Followed by a space it pushes
F1A7                             ; the body"s address instead. Either way it then skips to the matching "]'.
F1A7                             ; (The unchecked build takes anything that is not a letter as the space; the
F1A7                             ; checked build stops on it.)
F1A7                          IF   CHECKED   
F1A7   81 DF        DEF1:     CMPA   #" "-"A"+256   
F1A9   27 1E                  BEQ   def2   
F1AB   31 3F                  LEAY   -1,Y   ; anything but a letter or a space: W. The
F1AD   10 9F 36               STY   <AT   ;   place is that character, just read
F1B0   16 01 73               LBRA   e_brack   
F1B3                          ENDIF      
