F1F8   5C           SK3:      INCB      
F1F9   20 DE                  BRA   sk1   
F1FB                             ; 22h, checked build (the unchecked one is with the handlers below).
F1FB                             ; Checked: a NUL ends the string too, even right after a "/"; skipstr then
F1FB                             ; returns A = FFh with the carry set (the carry is clear at the quote), and
